749813909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256060/extras/2737dc8f0ed821283d4ab6c3f619c6df.mp4?t=1749813909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256060/extras/15ab61395f7d01429847b8b72a4e7a33.webp?t=1749813909\" width=744 height=56 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle storytelling with a lot of hidden lore for conspiracy lovers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the cryptic history of X-corps, the DMI moon, and its connection to humanity\u2019s survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings that make you question your choices \u2014 who is the man at the door? Did I really <i>save</i> Humanity?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for conspiracy theorists who love piecing together subtle story clues.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Unravel the eerie secrets of Droian, a sci-fi horror metroidvania. Guide a lone I.A.N bot through a desolate moon to save humanity, battling twisted creatures of flesh and machine. Explore dark, labyrinthine environments and uncover cryptic mysteries, where every path holds a chilling surprise.",
