        "notes": "Droian contains scenes and elements that may not be suitable for younger audiences. The game features enemies and bosses with disturbing, gore-like transformations that blend flesh and machinery, creating unsettling and intense visual experiences. These designs, despite being pixel art and not fully explicit include contorted bodies, disembodied heads, exposed eyes, and other body parts fused with mechanical elements.\r\n\r\nPlayers should be aware that Droian is a sci-fi horror game designed to provoke tension and fear through its mix of mechanical and biological horrors, but it does not contain explicit adult themes outside of its horror elements."
